  <h1>Joules to Volts Calculator</h1>
  <p>Converting energy (joules) to voltage (volts) isn't a direct one-step calculation. You need one more piece of information: either the <strong>charge</strong> (in coulombs) or the <strong>capacitance</strong> (in farads). This tool handles both cases. Enter your values below to get the voltage instantly.</p>

  <div class="card">
